eference <Video 1>. The video maintains a vertical 9:16 composition with elegant rim lighting against a dark atmospheric background.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the ancient Chinese beauty's facial features, hair styling with golden ornament, jade-green traditional silk outfit, gold embroidery, necklace, earrings, and waist belt are fully retained.\n<Video 1> (dance movement reference): attribute_transfer - the sensual dance movements, body rhythm, hip sways, arm crossing and waving patterns, and overall dance flow from <Video 1> are transferred to <Subject 1>.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a cinematic vertical 9:16 format with soft warm side lighting and a dark, misty atmospheric background with subtle haze.\n[Shot 1] A medium-full vertical shot centers <Subject 1>, the ancient Chinese beauty in jade-green traditional attire with golden ornaments, against a dark gradient background with warm rim light outlining her hair and shoulders. She begins the dance with a gentle, alluring smile, her body swaying smoothly from side to side in a rhythmic motion. Her right arm raises gracefully with fingers delicately extended while her left hand rests near her waist, palm slightly open. Her hips move in fluid circular motions, and her upper torso undulates naturally following the rhythm. The green silk fabric of her robe and sleeves ripples softly with each movement, catching highlights from the side light. Her golden hair ornament and earrings glint as she tilts her head slightly. The camera holds steady at eye level, capturing the full-body dance movement with balanced head-to-mid-calf framing. By the end of the 5 seconds, she has completed a full side-to-side body wave sequence and brings both arms up in front of her chest in a graceful crossed gesture, then opens them outward in a flowing motion.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft ambient room tone with subtle reverb, creating an intimate and atmospheric dance space.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA slow, sensual instrumental piece with soft piano melodies and gentle string undertones at a moderate tempo, with a warm, intimate quality that builds slightly toward the end."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [239.94027709960938, 205.51930236816406], "pos": [-1947.5523681640625, 4600.8837890625], "id": 142, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [284], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "frame_count", "label": "frame_count", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "frame_count"}, {"name": "audio", "links": [283], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"name": "video_info", "label": "video_info", "type": "VHS_VIDEOINFO", "localized_name": "video_info"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": {"custom_height": 0, "force_rate": 0, "custom_width": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "frame_load_cap": 0, "videopreview": {"paused": false, "hidden": false, "params": {"custom_height": 0, "force_rate": 0, "filename": "be3979257d0fd7a89de7b26a178ea83cea3112197240092719a24ecbb39428d4.mp4", "custom_width": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "frame_load_cap": 0, "format": "video/mp4", "skip_first_frames": 0, "type": "input"}}, "format": "AnimateDiff", "video": "be3979257d0fd7a89de7b26a178ea83cea3112197240092719a24ecbb39428d4.mp4", "skip_first_frames": 0, "force_size": "Disabled", "choose video to upload": "image"}, "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "meta_batch", "label": "meta_batch", "type": "VHS_BatchManager", "localized_name": "meta_batch"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "video"}, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_rate"}, "nam